        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-0IHK4JMdkezgVTsBbej-43" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="HQ Set up&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Cisoc 8190CX - allows for 4 connections and has a build in firewall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;3-Catalyst 2690 x 48 Ports allows capacity with the room to graw.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VLANS Strategy&lt;br&gt;All VLANS will be /24. It will allow each group to grow withoout modifying the VLANS routinline.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Corportate 10.10.20.0/24&lt;div&gt;- Sales 10.10.30.0/24&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-Engineering 10.10.40.0/24&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-IT 172.16.10.0/24&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DHCP strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Sales, corporate, engineering, and 1/4 of the IT block will be DHCP assignable. The other 3/4 of the block of IT will be set asside for servers, printers, and devices that can&#39;t have their IP address randomly moved by the DORA process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Servers&lt;br&gt;All server will be placed off HQSW2 as that is were the IDF that host IT eqiipmnet is at.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Routing to Internet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We will use PAT to allow routing from LAN to WWW as our strategy. PAT allows one IP to many.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fault Tolerance:&lt;br&gt;HQSW1 &amp;amp; HQSW2 will both be connected to HQRT1 to allow for tollarance. HQSW3 will be trunked to HQSW1&amp;amp;HQSW2 to allo for tollrance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="713" width="270" x="-590" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-0IHK4JMdkezgVTsBbej-44" parent="1" style="text;align=center;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=3;spacingRight=3;strokeColor=none;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;html=1;" value="HQRT1" vertex="1">
