        <mxCell id="-0IHK4JMdkezgVTsBbej-77" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Branch Set up&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Cisoc 8190CX - allows for 4 connections and has a build in firewall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;1 -Catalyst 2690 x 48 Ports allows capacity with the room to grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;DHCP will be dont from the router. as DORA does not work well over L3.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VLANS&lt;br&gt;- Corportate 10.10.50.0/24&lt;div&gt;- Sales 10.10.60.0/24&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-Engineering 10.10.70.0/24&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Routing to Internet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We will use PAT to allow routing from LAN to WWW as our strategy. PAT allows one IP to many.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VPN Connection between sites for file services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
