        <mxCell id="Vo-OtVaZnX2e0pKxzEcq-21" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="STP:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Spanning Tree (SPT)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We will use RSTP and HQSW1, based off the LAN toployg will be the STP Root.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I expect the STP to block the path between HQSW2 &amp;amp; HQSW3 as both switches have a direct link to the router.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I if root fails I expect the HQSW2 to become the primary STP Root switch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
